  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "PeerSharp 4.0.0 is a major release. Breaking: the library's failures now share one root, PeerSharpException - parse failures are TorrentMetadataException rather than FormatException, and StorageException and UdpTrackerException moved to PeerSharp.Exceptions. TotalSize now reports content rather than piece space. The default listen port is 6881. A configured proxy that cannot carry UDP now refuses DHT, proxied uTP, and proxied UDP tracker traffic instead of sending it directly. Fixes include v2 file layout, v2 tail-piece verification, BEP 10 extension id zero, and selection counters after a recheck. See https://github.com/ligenq/PeerSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md.",
